WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.449
One of the great things that is
lacking in most of our companies is that

00:00:03.449 --> 00:00:07.000
they are not teaching us how to lead.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.410
And leadership is a skill like any other.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.491
It is a practicable, learnable skill

00:00:12.491 --> 00:00:14.505
and it is something that you work on

00:00:14.505 --> 00:00:15.900
it's like a muscle.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.188
If you practice it all the days
you will get good at it

00:00:18.188 --> 00:00:19.900
and you will become a strong leader.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.680
If you stop practicing
you will become a weak leader.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.902
Like parenting

00:00:23.902 --> 00:00:27.394
everyone has the capacity to be a parent

00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:30.100
doesn't mean everybody wants to be a parent

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.250
and doesn't mean everybody should be a parent.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.300
Leadership is the same.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.489
We all have the capacity to be a leader

00:00:38.489 --> 00:00:40.056
doesn't mean everybody should be a leader

00:00:40.056 --> 00:00:41.700
and it doesn't mean everybody wants to be a leader.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:47.660
And the reason is because
it comes at great personal sacrifice.

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.702
Remember you're not in charge.

00:00:49.702 --> 00:00:52.730
You're responsible for those in your charge.

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:54.200
That means things like

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.579
when everything goes right,
you have to give away all the credit.

00:00:56.579 --> 00:01:00.210
And when everything goes wrong,
you have to take all the responsibility.

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:04.060
That sucks.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.630
It's things like
staying late to show somebody what to do.

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.900
It's things like
when something does actually break,

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.490
when something goes wrong

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:15.620
instead of yelling and screaming
and taking over

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:17.700
you say, "try again"

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.900
when the overwhelming pressures are not on them,

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:22.770
the overwhelming pressures are on us.

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:23.809
At the end of the day

00:01:23.809 --> 00:01:26.430
great leaders are not responsible for the job

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:31.870
they're responsible for the people
who are responsible for the job.

